Sambhaal Rakhiyaan Guitar Chords with Strumming Pattern from Bollywood Hindi movie Music Teacher sung by Neeti Mohan.

Strumming Pattern: DDDU

[E]Jis rozz teri akhiyaan,        [C#m]Maine phli baar takiyaan
[B]Wo din or uski [F#m] ghadiyaan,        [A]Rakhiyaan sambhaal [B]rakhiyaan

[E]Tainu yaad-yaad krke,        [C#m]Vey me taryaan nu padhke
[B]Kat ya jo sari [F#m]rattiyaan,        [A]Rakhiyaan sambhal [B]rakhiyaan

[E]Rabba mere jeene ki [A]wajah hai,        Wo nasha hai mera [B] dil tarsey
[E]Baarishein bhi beet gyi [B] bin barse,        [F#m]Ese na [A] sazaade yr [B] vey

[E]Tainu vekh-vekh ji lu [B] ji bharke,        [E]Teri he rahoon me yara [B] chaahe mar ke
[F#m]Mujh ko ye [A] dua de yaar [B]vey

[E]Hoo wo oh wooh,        [C#m]Ho ooh, oow wooh
[A]Hoo hoo ooh [F#m]oooh,        [B]Hoo hoo woo

[E]Ho oho woo owoh,        [C#m]Ho ooh, woo, wooh
[A]Howw, ooh ooh,[F#m]hoo,        [B]Hoo ooh, oow

<!-- Post Middle -->

[E]Guzre hein lamhein kis [A]s taraah tere [B]bin,        [A]Tu na jane [B] tu na jaane [G#]
[E]Hona hai mera [A] be wajaah tere [B]bin,        [A]Tu na jaane [B] tu na jane
Jaane [A]Fir kyu [G#] umeedaan [B] rakhiyaan

[E]Paagal hai meri akhiyaan,        [C#m]Khudko na rok sakiyaan
[B]Teri wekh-wekh [F#m]raha,        [A]Thak yaan na yr [B] thakiyaan

[E]Tennu yaad yaad krke,        [C#m]Vey me taaryaan nu padhke
[B]Katya jo saari [F#m] rattiyaan,        [A]Rakhiyaan sambhaal [B]rakkhiyaan

[E]Rabba mere jeene ki [A]wajah hai,        Wo nashaa hai mera [B] dil tarsey
[E]Barishein bhi beet gyi [B]bin barse,        [F#m]Aise na [A]sza de yr [B] vey

